          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 439,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:1",
          "start": 374
        },
        "quote": "(b) A person commits a disorderly persons offense if such person:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "c6493609-2c30-5a8b-bb5b-85b3ad5e77ea",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 614,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:2",
          "start": 440
        },
        "quote": "(1) Wanders, remains or prowls in a public place with the purpose of unlawfully obtaining or distributing a controlled dangerous substance or controlled substance analog; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "b727d073-f1df-50f5-abbf-c0318dda2d59",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 777,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:3",
          "start": 615
        },
        "quote": "(2) Engages in conduct that, under the circumstances, manifests a purpose to obtain or distribute a controlled dangerous substance or controlled substance analog.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "bce2816c-115b-5a2a-bbc3-61655e85932e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1033,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:4",
          "start": 778
        },
        "quote": "(c) Conduct that may, where warranted under the circumstances, be deemed adequate to manifest a purpose to obtain or distribute a controlled dangerous substance or controlled substance analog includes, but is not limited to, conduct such as the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5755726c-b694-5a65-a17f-1a2965f0b6e6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1117,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:5",
          "start": 1034
        },
        "quote": "(1) Repeatedly beckoning to or stopping pedestrians or motorists in a public place.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "44ce9b3c-8a5b-5264-8933-7da495864441",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1221,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:6",
          "start": 1118
        },
        "quote": "(2) Repeatedly passing objects to or receiving objects from pedestrians or motorists in a public place.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "4efd2127-5aa6-5f2f-b560-a7fe440ff197",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1390,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:7",
          "start": 1222
        },
        "quote": "(3) Repeatedly circling in a public place in a motor vehicle and on one or more occasions passing any object to or receiving any object from a person in a public place.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.45.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6be07252-2ef8-5600-859c-a1c5fc3ae894",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
