          "start": 1391
        },
        "quote": "(d) The element of the offense described in subsection (b)(1) of this section may not be established solely by proof that the actor engaged in the conduct that is used to satisfy the element described in subsection (b)(2) of this section. (Ord. 16660 § 1, 12-14-93. Code 1995 § 54-122.)",
